{
  "id": 2086,
  "name": "party-sparkler-pick",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "自動で　小さな花火が　燃える　ピック。パーティーや　おめでたい席で　使われている。燃え終わったときの　匂いは　クセになる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "자동으로 작은 폭죽이 타오르는 픽. 파티나 축하하는 자리에 많이 사용된다. 다 타고 난 뒤에 나는 냄새가 중독성 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "會自動燃放小型火花的小籤。用於派對或喜慶等場合。火花燃盡後留下的氣味獨具特色。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique qui émet automatiquement de petites étincelles. Utilisée dans les fêtes, elle dégage un parfum étrangement plaisant lorsqu’elle est consumée.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Dieser Pikser entfacht automatisch ein kleines Feuerwerk und eignet sich bestens für Partys oder festliche Anlässe. Ist er abgebrannt, hinterlässt er einen angenehmen Duft.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un palillo del que saltan unas pequeñas chispas, ideal para fiestas u ocasiones especiales. El olor que deja tras apagarse es agradable.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino che produce piccole scintille. Viene usato alle feste o in occasioni speciali. Una volta spento lascia un odore sorprendentemente gradevole.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This pick features a small sparkler that goes off automatically. It’s used at parties or for guests of honor. It leaves an oddly appealing aroma once it’s burned out.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自動で　小さな花火が　燃える　ピック。パーティーや　おめでたい席で　使われている。燃え終わったときの　匂いは　クセになる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "会自动烧起小火花的签子。会用在派对或喜庆场合。燃尽后的味道会让人上瘾。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
